      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَافِقٌ</span></b>  A camel <i>lying,</i> or <i>sleeping, upon one
side one time and upon the other side another
time.</i> (O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَافِقٌ بَيْنَ ثَوْبَيْنِ</span> <i>Wearing two garments, one of them over the other.</i>
(Ibn-'Abbád, O.)

